WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.240
I'm scared to click.
I don't know this one.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:08.680
Dude, this, this clip, this clip of
Leon with his hands behind his back,

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.360
showing off a patch of dirt.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.340
This one turned out disturbing, bro.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.840
Of course it'd be me, right?

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.400
Did you think this wouldn't end
with everyone laughing at me?

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.200
No, nobody's laughing, everyone's scared.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.240
I'm alive, guys.
Look, alive and kicking, see? Alive.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.660
Drop this, Nilce!
